                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This data package contains (meta) data, analysis scripts, and relevant documents for the project: Why Bargainers with Many Resources in Coalition Formation Ask Too Much \r\n\r\nThe research pits two explanations for the use of proportional allocation rules by strong bargainers in coalition formation against each other: 1) a myopic focus on proportional allocation rules 2) strategic application of proportional allocation rules.\r\n"
                },
